; A small stand-in for a GlobalPlatform EAT-style profile schema, playing
; `gp_eap.cddl`'s role in the `;# constrain` fixture. Array-shaped since
; `.cborseq`'s controller type describes the reassembled sequence-as-array
; (RFC 8610 §3.8.4), not a per-element type.

Something = [
    claim : tstr,
    value : int,
]
